  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "year() — o ano (UTC) de um timestamp",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Analogia:** `year()` é o **ano estampado na moeda**: extrai o ano de um timestamp, em **UTC**.\nPegadinha clássica: o **Réveillon do Prometheus** acontece às **21h de 31/12 em Brasília**.\n\nMétricas: `year_simulated_clock_timestamp_seconds` (**relógio acelerado** em volta da virada 2026→2027: 1 hora a cada 10s)\ne `year_device_manufactured_timestamp_seconds{device}` (sensor-a 2019, router-b 2022, nobreak-c 01/01/2026 01:30 UTC).\n\n📘 Guia completo: `functions/year/README.md`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "1. Réveillon acelerado: UTC vira 30s antes de Brasília",
      "description": "year() UTC pula para 2027 à meia-noite UTC. year(t - 3h) (Brasília) pula 3 'horas' (30s) depois.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "min",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "year(year_simulated_clock_timestamp_seconds)",
          "legendFormat": "ano UTC",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "year(year_simulated_clock_timestamp_seconds - 3 * 3600)",
          "legendFormat": "ano Brasília",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "2. Hoje",
      "description": "",
